      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "How does a ReplicaSet know which pods are its own? Labels."
        },
        {
          "text": "Every pod carries labels, small key and value tags. Ours all carry the same name label, set to golinks."
        },
        {
          "text": "The ReplicaSet's selector matches that label, so it counts these two pods as its own."
        },
        {
          "text": "A pod with a different label, like the database we'll add later, is invisible to it.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
