        {
          "text": "Then the Deployment itself."
        },
        {
          "text": "Ask for all three layers at once, and there they are: the Deployment, its ReplicaSet, and two pods."
        },
        {
          "text": "Each pod's name is the ReplicaSet's name plus a random suffix. The ReplicaSet's name is the Deployment's, plus a hash of the pod template."
        },
        {
          "text": "But look at READY: zero of one, on both pods.",
          "say": "But look at the ready column: zero of one, on both pods.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
