      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Last idea: what happens when there's a new version."
        },
        {
          "text": "Change the image in the manifest and apply it, and the Deployment makes a second ReplicaSet for the new template."
        },
        {
          "text": "It brings up a new pod, and once that one is ready, retires an old one."
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the next, until every pod runs the new version. That's a rolling update, and nobody notices the swap."
        },
        {
          "text": "The old ReplicaSet stays around, scaled to zero, so rolling back is a single command.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
